{"seq":1,"slug":"anomaly-detection","title":"异常检测","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/time-series-deep-learning/applications/anomaly-detection","wordCount":1736,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"异常检测\">异常检测</h1><p>凌晨三点，某支付系统的交易量曲线突然塌陷，监控系统在 90 秒内报警，工程师介入避免了一场重大故障。背后做判断的，正是一个时序异常检测模型。它没有「异常样本」可学——故障太罕见、形态各异、根本标不全——所以它换了个思路：把「正常」学得足够好，凡是模型预测不准或重构不出的片段，就判为异常。这个「以正常为锚」的范式，是时序异常检测与普通分类最根本的不同，也让它和预测共享同一套 <a href=\"../architectures/\">深度架构</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>时序异常检测的主流是无监督或半监督：只用（大量）正常数据训练，让模型建立「正常模式」的内部表征，再用某种偏离度量给每个时间点打异常分。两大技术路线是预测式（预测不准即异常）与重构式（重构不出即异常），最后都归结为「异常分 + 阈值」。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[历史正常数据] --&gt; B{建模范式}&#10;    B --&gt;|预测式| C[预测下一步&lt;br/&gt;用预测误差打分]&#10;    B --&gt;|重构式| D[自编码器重构&lt;br/&gt;用重构误差打分]&#10;    C --&gt; E[异常分序列]&#10;    D --&gt; E&#10;    E --&gt; F[阈值判定]&#10;    F --&gt; G{超过阈值}&#10;    G --&gt;|是| H[标记异常]&#10;    G --&gt;|否| I[正常]&#10;    H --&gt; J[告警 / 人工复核]\">flowchart TD\n    A[历史正常数据] --&gt; B{建模范式}\n    B --&gt;|预测式| C[预测下一步&lt;br/&gt;用预测误差打分]\n    B --&gt;|重构式| D[自编码器重构&lt;br/&gt;用重构误差打分]\n    C --&gt; E[异常分序列]\n    D --&gt; E\n    E --&gt; F[阈值判定]\n    F --&gt; G{超过阈值}\n    G --&gt;|是| H[标记异常]\n    G --&gt;|否| I[正常]\n    H --&gt; J[告警 / 人工复核]</pre><p>下表对比异常的三种典型形态与适用方法：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>异常类型</th>\n<th>描述</th>\n<th>例子</th>\n<th>适合的方法</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>点异常</td>\n<td>单个离群点</td>\n<td>传感器尖峰</td>\n<td>预测残差、阈值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>上下文异常</td>\n<td>值正常但情境反常</td>\n<td>夏天 0 度</td>\n<td>预测式、季节建模</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>集体异常</td>\n<td>一段子序列整体反常</td>\n<td>设备渐变故障</td>\n<td>重构式、子序列</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"预测式异常检测\">预测式异常检测</h2><p>预测式方法的逻辑直白：用 <a href=\"../architectures/rnn-lstm\">RNN/LSTM</a>、<a href=\"../architectures/tcn-cnn\">TCN</a> 或 <a href=\"../architectures/transformers-ts\">Transformer</a> 在正常数据上训一个预测模型，上线时把实际值与模型预测值比较，残差越大越可疑。异常分通常就是预测误差：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>或</mtext><mspace width=\"1em\"/><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><mi>σ</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s_t = |y_t - \\hat{y}_t| \\quad \\text{或} \\quad s_t = \\frac{|y_t - \\hat{y}_t|}{\\sigma}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1944em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">或</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.113em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1944em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>它的优势是可解释——你能直接看到「模型以为该是 100，实际却是 5」；且天然适合上下文异常（值本身不极端、但与历史模式不符时预测会失准）。局限是依赖预测精度：序列本身就难预测时，正常波动也会产生大残差、误报频发。一个进阶做法是用 <a href=\"../modern/probabilistic-forecasting\">概率预测</a> 给出的预测区间替代点残差——落在 99% 区间外才算异常，把不确定性纳入判定，比固定阈值更稳健。</p>\n<h2 id=\"重构式异常检测\">重构式异常检测</h2><p>重构式方法不预测未来，而是训练一个自编码器（或变分自编码器、Transformer 自编码器）去「复述」输入：把一段序列压缩再还原。在正常数据上训练后，模型只学会了重构正常模式，遇到异常片段就还原得很差，重构误差因此成为异常分：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>x</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msub><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s_t = \\| x_t - \\hat{x}_t \\|^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∥</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1141em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2222em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∥</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>重构式天然擅长集体异常——一整段渐变故障会让重构持续失真。2025 年的研究热点集中在 Transformer 自编码器、VAE-Transformer 混合、以及记忆增强（如 MEMTO 用记忆模块存正常原型）等方向，针对的都是重构式的一个顽疾——过度泛化：模型有时把异常也重构得太好，反而漏报。为此还出现了 TimesNet 等把序列变换到 2D 来建模周期内/周期间变化的通用骨架。无论预测式还是重构式，最后都要把异常分序列转成 0/1 判定，这一步的阈值选择（静态分位数、动态自适应、极值理论）往往比模型本身更影响最终效果。</p>\n<h2 id=\"阈值选择与流式部署\">阈值选择与流式部署</h2><p>把连续的异常分变成 0/1 判定，靠的是阈值，而阈值往往比模型本身更左右最终的误报率与漏报率。最简单的静态阈值取正常数据异常分的某个高分位（如 99.9%），实现容易但对分布漂移脆弱——一旦正常模式随时间变化，固定阈值就会要么频繁误报、要么集体漏报。更稳健的是动态阈值：用滑动窗口持续估计异常分的均值与标准差，按 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>μ</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>k</mi><mi>σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mu + k\\sigma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span></span></span> 实时调整判定线，适应缓慢漂移。对极端罕见的故障，还可用极值理论（如 POT，超阈值峰值法）专门为分布尾部建模，给出更有统计依据的阈值。</p>\n<p>流式部署还带来三个工程约束。其一是延迟：监控场景常要求秒级甚至亚秒级出告警，因此偏好 <a href=\"../architectures/tcn-cnn\">TCN</a> 或可增量更新的 <a href=\"../architectures/rnn-lstm\">RNN</a>，而非每次重算整窗的重型模型。其二是告警疲劳：误报过多会让运维人员对告警麻木，因此常加入去抖动（连续多点异常才报）、告警聚合、按严重度分级等后处理。其三是冷启动与反馈闭环：上线初期正常数据不足，模型需边运行边学习，并把人工确认的真/假告警回流用于阈值校准。这些部署考量与 <a href=\"domains-deployment\">行业落地与部署</a> 的 MLOps 闭环一脉相承。</p>\n<h2 id=\"评估陷阱-被高估的进步\">评估陷阱：被高估的进步</h2><p>这是本篇最该警惕的部分。时序异常检测的评估长期被一个看似合理却严重误导的技巧污染——点调整（point adjustment, PA）。它的规则是：只要一段连续异常区间里有任意一个点被检出，就把整段都算作正确检出。这听起来宽容合理，实则极度放水：研究表明，即便一个完全随机打分的「模型」，套上点调整后也能在常用基准上刷出近乎完美的 F1。这意味着大量声称 SOTA 的论文，其「进步」可能是点调整制造的幻觉。</p>\n<p>因此 2025 至 2026 年的严肃评测强烈呼吁：报告不带点调整的原始指标，或改用对范围更敏感、不易被作弊的指标（如基于范围的精确率/召回率、affiliation 指标、VUS-ROC/VUS-PR 等）。同时也有研究批评现有基准数据集本身存在标注错误、异常过于平凡（一眼可辨）的问题，「制造了进步的幻觉」。这套警惕与 <a href=\"evaluation-backtesting\">评估与回测</a> 的核心精神完全一致：评估方法错了，再高的分数也是自欺。选型时务必用可信指标、在干净基准上比较，并保留充分的人工复核。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>时序异常检测以「学正常、测偏离」为核心范式，无监督/半监督为主，与预测共享深度架构。</li>\n<li>预测式用预测残差打分，可解释、擅长上下文异常；配合 <a href=\"../modern/probabilistic-forecasting\">概率预测</a> 区间更稳健。</li>\n<li>重构式用自编码器重构误差打分，擅长集体异常，但有过度泛化漏报之患。</li>\n<li>阈值选择常比模型更影响效果；异常分到 0/1 判定这一步不可忽视。</li>\n<li>警惕点调整（PA）制造的虚假高分，改用 VUS 等抗作弊指标，呼应 <a href=\"evaluation-backtesting\">评估与回测</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"异常检测","id":"异常检测"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"预测式异常检测","id":"预测式异常检测"},{"level":2,"text":"重构式异常检测","id":"重构式异常检测"},{"level":2,"text":"阈值选择与流式部署","id":"阈值选择与流式部署"},{"level":2,"text":"评估陷阱：被高估的进步","id":"评估陷阱-被高估的进步"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"多变量与长程预测","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/time-series-deep-learning/modern/multivariate-long-horizon"},"next":{"title":"评估与回测","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/time-series-deep-learning/applications/evaluation-backtesting"}}